<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd"
  identifier="sat-c2-u17-accommodating-yourturn" title="Your Turn: Accommodating" adaptive="true" time-dependent="false">

  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>D</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"/>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>show_interaction</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>

  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="show_interaction" outcome-identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" show-hide="show" class="qti-margin-0">
      <qti-content-body>
        <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1">
          <qti-prompt>Which sentence uses accommodating correctly?</qti-prompt>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="A">The auditorium felt accommodating once we finally found four empty seats together by the window.</qti-simple-choice>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="B">The recipe is accommodating enough to feed a dozen hungry guests out of a single pot.</qti-simple-choice>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="C">He gave an accommodating shrug and admitted he had no idea where the spare keys were kept.</qti-simple-choice>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="D">Our accommodating guide swapped the museum morning for the tide pools the twins wanted.</qti-simple-choice>
        </qti-choice-interaction>
      </qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>

    <qti-feedback-block identifier="correct" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Correct. The guide reworks the plan itself — museum out, tide pools in — to fit what the twins need, which is accommodating exactly.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="incorrect" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>The right sentence is the guide's, who changes the itinerary to fit the twins. A roomy hall, a stretchable recipe, and a vague shrug involve no one adjusting anything for anyone — accommodating means helpfully bending your own arrangements to others' needs.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-A" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Empty seats 'together by the window' just make a hall roomy — physical space, not helpfulness. Accommodating describes someone who bends plans to fit what other people need; a building cannot choose to be flexible.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-B" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>A dish feeding a dozen 'out of a single pot' is generous in quantity, nothing more. Accommodating is about willingness — a person adjusting their own arrangements for others — which no recipe can show.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-C" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Admitting 'no idea where the spare keys were kept' offers no help at all; an easy shrug is not service. To be accommodating, someone must actually adjust plans or provide something another person needs.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body>

  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-correct identifier="RESPONSE"/></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">1</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">completed</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">correct</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
      <qti-response-else>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incorrect</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-else>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">A</qti-base-value></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-A</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">B</qti-base-value></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-B</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">C</qti-base-value></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-C</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>
